  "reason": "Monty rejects generator functions at parse time. The pinned Monty v1.0.0 limitations list (scripts/prefix/monty-reference/v1.0.0/docs/limitations/language.md, card be98cdf265c1) states yield/yield from expressions are not supported — there are no generator functions. The same is recorded in limitations/index.md (card 6ae8c4c80d41) and limitations/comprehensions.md (card df38d3c88991). A Monty component body must therefore not use yield; doing so raises NotImplementedError before any code runs. A BrassClaw authored PythonCode component additionally forbids such constructs under the authoring contract (skills.md card 5492db3e2b23, toolskills.md card 1627e3fec804).",
